سأحل المشاكل الثلاث: المحتوى الفارغ + اللوغو + اللغتين.

**في Webflow Site Settings > Custom Code:**

**1. Head Code — استبدل القديم بهذا كاملاً:**

```html
<style>
/* INTRSPOT v2 */
@keyframes intr-grad{0%,100%{background-position:0% 50%}50%{background-position:100% 50%}}
@keyframes intr-float{0%,100%{transform:translateY(0)}50%{transform:translateY(-16px)}}
@keyframes intr-pulse{0%,100%{opacity:.5;transform:scale(1)}50%{opacity:.85;transform:scale(1.06)}}

/* Fix hero visibility */
.intr-title,.intr-subtitle,.intr-actions,.intr-left,.intr-right{opacity:1!important;transform:translateY(0)!important}
.intr-grad-text{animation:intr-grad 6s ease infinite!important;background-size:200% 200%!important}

/* Blue theme */
.intr-btn-primary{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e6fff,#4f9eff)!important;box-shadow:0 0 40px rgba(30,111,255,.4),0 0 80px rgba(30,111,255,.12)!important}
.intr-stat-n{color:#4f9eff!important}
.intr-badge{border-color:rgba(79,158,255,.3)!important;color:#4f9eff!important;background:rgba(30,111,255,.08)!important}
.intr-dashboard{box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(30,100,255,.2),0 0 0 1px rgba(79,158,255,.1)!important}
.intr-svc-icon{background:rgba(30,111,255,.12)!important;border-color:rgba(30,111,255,.2)!important;color:#4f9eff!important}

/* Logo fix */
.intr-logo{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e6fff,#4f9eff)!important;font-size:0!important;width:38px!important;height:38px!important}
.intr-logo::after{content:'BI';font-size:13px!important;font-weight:900!important;color:#fff!important;display:flex!important;align-items:center!important;justify-content:center!important;height:100%!important}

/* Language toggle */
#intrlang{position:fixed;bottom:28px;left:28px;z-index:9999;display:flex;gap:4px;background:rgba(4,8,18,.9);border:1px solid rgba(79,158,255,.25);border-radius:28px;padding:4px;backdrop-filter:blur(16px);box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,20,.4)}
#intrlang button{background:none;border:none;color:#64748b;padding:7px 18px;border-radius:24px;cursor:pointer;font-family:Tajawal,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;transition:all .25s}
#intrlang button.active{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#1e6fff,#4f9eff);color:#fff;box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(30,111,255,.45)}
</style>
```

---

**2. Footer Code — أضف هذا (جديد):**

```html
<script>
(function(){
var T={
  '.intr-grad-text':{ar:'حوّل بياناتك إلى<br>قرارات ذكية',en:'Turn Your Data Into<br>Smart Decisions'},
  '.intr-subtitle':{ar:'منصة ذكاء الأعمال الرائدة — نبني لوحات تحكم وتقارير وحلول No-Code تُسرّع نمو شركتك',en:'Leading BI Platform — We build dashboards, reports & No-Code solutions to accelerate your business growth'},
  '.intr-btn-primary':{ar:'ابدأ مجاناً ←',en:'Get Started Free →'},
  '.intr-btn-secondary':{ar:'شاهد كيف يعمل',en:'See How It Works'}
};
var lang=localStorage.getItem('intrlang')||'ar';
function apply(l){
  document.documentElement.lang=l;
  document.documentElement.dir=l==='ar'?'rtl':'ltr';
  Object.keys(T).forEach(function(s){var e=document.querySelector(s);if(e)e.innerHTML=T[s][l];});
  document.querySelectorAll('#intrlang button').forEach(function(b){b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.l===l);});
  localStorage.setItem('intrlang',l);lang=l;
}
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',function(){
  var w=document.createElement('div');w.id='intrlang';
  ['ar','en'].forEach(function(l){
    var b=document.createElement('button');
    b.textContent=l==='ar'?'عربي':'EN';b.dataset.l=l;
    b.onclick=function(){apply(l);};w.appendChild(b);
  });
  document.body.appendChild(w);apply(lang);
});
})();
</script>
```

---

**3. بعد الحفظ → Publish**

بعد النشر ستحصل على:
- محتوى الـ hero ظاهر ✅
- اللوغو يقرأ "BI" بدل "ذ" ✅
- زر **عربي | EN** ثابت في أسفل اليسار ✅

